Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- lib/articles.ts: 3 curated articles summarized from real สบส./government
  news coverage (hcpr.hss.moph.go.th, bangkokbiznews citing สบส., Thai PBS
  citing สบส.+อย.), each tagged sourceType official/news for badge display
- app/articles/page.tsx: listing page with a trust bar up front (explains
  the sourcing model) + featured article + grid, each card showing a
  verified-source badge and citation
- app/articles/[slug]/page.tsx: statically generated detail page per
  article with source badge, full citation box linking to the original,
  and a legal-advice disclaimer
- components/Nav.tsx: flip บทความ menu item from disabled (href: null) to
  /articles, per the existing TODO comment

Verified with tsc --noEmit (clean). Full 'next build' could not be run in
this sandbox because outbound access to fonts.googleapis.com is blocked by
the sandbox's network proxy (confirmed this also fails on bare main before
this commit, unrelated to these changes) -- Render's build environment has
normal internet access so this will not affect the real deploy.
